      "side": 1,
      "message": "I found __hw_clock_source_read() might not be suitable to this case since the preload value might not be TICK_ITIM32_MAX_CNT. \n\nFor example, if __hw_clock_source_set(0xFFFFFFF0) is executed by force_time, the reading of __hw_clock_source_read() be between 0x0 to 0x10. Consider \"(__hw_clock_source_read() - start) \u003e LPC_HOST_TRANSACTION_TIMEOUT_US\", this condition won\u0027t be true forever.",
